    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21864" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">imperco</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">inp-</span></b> ,
		also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">imparco</span></b> ),
			ĕre, v. n., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to spare</i>
