				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">huic impercito,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Cas. 4, 4, 12</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">imperce, quaeso,</span>”
				<i>spare yourself</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Am. 1, 3, 2</span></i>
			.</div>
